The four files in source/src/components/ui/ (badge.tsx, button.tsx,
card.tsx, tabs.tsx) were adapted by quirq-ai/website from shadcn/ui
(https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui), new-york-v4 registry. button.tsx names
the shadcn commit it came from, shadcn-ui/ui@6efecd8; the other three do
not record one. They are rewrites (forwardRef, a class map instead of
class-variance-authority), restyled with the website's tokens. This notice
was added by quirq-ai/ui, not copied from the website, and is used under
the licence below.

